### Stop all workers
POST http://0.0.0.0:8082/fetcher-be/api/queue/workers/stop
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "worker_ids": []
}

### Stop specific workers by ID
POST http://localhost:8080/fetcher-be/api/queue/workers/stop
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "worker_ids": ["worker-id-1", "worker-id-2"]
}
